 *
 * Four nested fields step downward by two pixels from the light core to the outer silhouette, creating direction without a separate shade. The tones are adjacent fills rather than alternating
 * outlines, and the family face breaks the centre, guarding against a target
 * reading at small sizes.
 *
 * The face uses the measured md/gap3 geometry:
 * field y8-19,
 * 1px air above and 1px below.
 */
